{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["Elohim of silver and eloheim of gold — even as a memorial to Heaven." "You shall not make — because there are in them those who err and suppose that they have substantive reality, even though the Holy One, blessed be He, commanded to make cherubim upon the ark for His dwelling. They were made as a likeness of the cherubim of the throne on high, and not to bow down to them."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:42:15.667646564Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}